OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leads to temporary
OL,4,Acharity closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity had to temporarily close
OL,7,Fearlier after it lost its water supply
OL,8,Fdue to a burst pipe.
OL,10,FWestbank Community Health and Care,
OL,11,Fwhich supports vulnerable people in
OL,12,FExminster, Devon, had to clear its
OL,13,Ffridges, cancel cookery lessons and
OL,14,Fclose its gym and nursery facilities.
OL,16,FWestbank's Sarah Hicks said she hoped
OL,17,F"very little" food would go to waste
OL,18,Fbut said the community organisation had
OL,19,Fsuffered a "major disruption".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
