OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leads to temporary
OL,4,Acharity closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said it was dealing
OL,7,Fwith a complex burst main in the EX5
OL,8,Farea and had deployed tankers to
OL,9,Fsupport the water network while it was
OL,10,Frepaired. It later confirmed "the
OL,11,Fmajority of supplies" affected had been
OL,12,Frestored and thanked locals for their
OL,13,Fpatience.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
